OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FA former X Factor finalist has denied
OL,7,Fmurdering a social media influencer by
OL,8,Frunning her over with a car.
OL,10,FGabrielle Carrington, 29, allegedly
OL,11,Fstruck Klaudia Zakrzewska outside the
OL,12,FInca nightclub in Argyll Street, Soho,
OL,13,Fat 4.30am on Sunday 19 April 2026.
OL,15,FCarrington, of Broadfield Road,
OL,16,FManchester, was initially charged with
OL,17,Fattempted murder but that was changed
OL,18,Fto murder after Ms Zakrzewska died
OL,19,Ffrom her injuries on 25 April.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
