PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785764955
OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FOn Monday 3 August, Carrington
OL,7,Fappeared at the Old Bailey by
OL,8,Fvideolink from Bronzefield prison
OL,9,Fwearing a low-cut black outfit and her
OL,10,Flong black hair pulled back.
OL,12,FThe defendant was not represented in
OL,13,Fcourt by a barrister and represented
OL,14,Fherself during the plea hearing.
OL,16,FAsked if she was happy to proceed
OL,17,Fwithout a lawyer, she told Judge Sarah
OL,18,FWhitehouse KC she did not want to
OL,19,Frepresent herself "for the
OL,20,Fforeseeable".
OL,26,@{D@SOU|D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785764955
OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FBut she added: "As I'm not
OL,7,Frepresented, I am happy to give a plea
OL,8,Ftoday even though I am not
OL,9,Frepresented."
OL,11,FCarrington pleaded not guilty to
OL,12,Fmurder and a second charge of causing
OL,13,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent to
OL,14,Fsecurity guard Anoush Chyche.
OL,16,FThe defendant was not asked to enter a
OL,17,Fplea to a third charge of driving with
OL,18,Fexcess alcohol.
OL,26,@nD@POUqD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785764955
OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FOn her decision on who would
OL,7,Fultimately represent her at her trial,
OL,8,Fshe said: "This is my life. This is
OL,9,Fthe toughest decision I have to make."
OL,11,FJudge Whitehouse confirmed she would
OL,12,Ftry the case at the Old Bailey from
OL,13,FJanuary 5.
OL,15,FShe set a further pre-trial hearing
OL,16,Ffor August 11 and October 9.
OL,18,FThe defendant interacted directly with
OL,19,Fthe judge and prosecutor Crispin
OL,20,FAylett KC in court, and made notes on
OL,21,Fa large pad of paper.
OL,26,@pD@KOUqD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
