OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785764955
OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FJudge Whitehouse remanded her into
OL,7,Fcustody but ordered the defendant be
OL,8,Fbrought to the Old Bailey for her next
OL,9,Fhearing.
OL,11,FIt is alleged that Carrington had
OL,12,Farrived in Argyll Street in her car
OL,13,Fand had appeared to have a row with a
OL,14,Fmale as she got out of the vehicle.
OL,16,FThe altercation escalated as more
OL,17,Fpeople became involved, prompting
OL,18,Fsecurity to intervene.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785764955
OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FCarrington allegedly got back into the
OL,7,Fcar and moved off, sharply mounting
OL,8,Fthe pavement, striking Ms Zakrzewska.
OL,10,FThe vehicle went on to strike a
OL,11,Fsecurity member of staff, Mr Chyche,
OL,12,Fwho was on the pavement, it is claimed.
OL,14,FAs it reversed, Ms Zakrzewska could be
OL,15,Fseen under the vehicle laying prone on
OL,16,Fthe ground.
OL,18,FAt 5am paramedics and police had
OL,19,Fattended the scene and found people
OL,20,Fshouting, many of whom had left the
OL,21,Fnearby Inca nightclub.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785764955
OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FMs Zakrzewska died later in hospital
OL,7,Fand Mr Chyche, in his 50s, suffered
OL,8,F"life-changing injuries".
OL,10,FThe incident happened on the Soho
OL,11,Fstreet which is home to the London
OL,12,FPalladium theatre.
OL,14,FAccording to the court charges,
OL,15,FCarrington had 61 microgrammes of
OL,16,Falcohol per 100 millilitres of breath
OL,17,Fwhen she tested after the incident.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
