PN,36308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1785764955
OL,3,CFormer X Factor finalist denies murder
OL,4,Cof influencer outside nightclub
OL,6,FThe defendant, who has more than
OL,7,F365,000 followers on Instagram under
OL,8,Fthe handle RIELLEUK, made it to the X
OL,9,FFactor live finals in 2013 as one of
OL,10,Fthe three members of Miss Dynamix.
OL,12,FMs Zakrzewska, who was in her 30s, was
OL,13,Fa TikTok and Instagram influencer who
OL,14,Fwent by the name Klaudiaglam.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/8
